([3] The appellant contends that corporate retained earnings should not be) Tj
T*
(included where an accountant) Tj
T*
(testifies that cash is held for business contingencies. We reject that) Tj
T*
(broad proposition. The primary) Tj
T*
(objective of the Guidelines is to ensure that children benefit from the) Tj
T*
(financial means of both parents.) Tj
T*
